{%- doc -%}
The slideshow's blur layer, drawn inside one slide right above the slide's background media (and under the logo and the text): it blurs
only what is behind it and adds no color. Intensity and styles are in sections/slideshow.liquid.

@param {number} intensity - the blur in px (section setting "blur_intensity"); nothing is drawn at 0
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if intensity > 0 -%}
  <div class="slideshow__blur" aria-hidden="true"></div>
{%- endif -%}
